From 4cd3003487a4cf37c548eb6f5d42c2ada9c84326 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mabn <github@mabn.pl>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:13:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/43] P1 v2: non-colliding aircraft depend only on their
 target (BAR: collide = false on all but four aircraft); no grid cells

---
 rts/Sim/MoveTypes/Systems/BrParallelAir.h     |   2 +-
 .../MoveTypes/Systems/GeneralMoveSystem.cpp   | 173 +++++++-----------
 2 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 109 deletions(-)

diff --git a/rts/Sim/MoveTypes/Systems/BrParallelAir.h b/rts/Sim/MoveTypes/Systems/BrParallelAir.h
